  "hindi": "वह अन्तरिक्ष में ऊँचा खड़ा हुआ; तब उसने वृत्र पर घातक आयुध चलाया। कुहरा धारण किए हुए वह उसकी ओर दौड़ा; तीक्ष्ण आयुधवाले इन्द्र ने शत्रु को जीत लिया।",
  "english": "He stood upright in the atmosphere; then he hurled the deadly weapon at Vṛtra. Wearing the mist, he ran up to him; Indra, sharp-weaponed, conquered the enemy.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "'adha' is printed with avagraha after hyāsthādadhyantarikṣe ('dhā) and read as adha. 'adhi antarikṣe' taken as 'in the atmosphere'. 'upa ... adudrot' taken as 'ran up to'; 'īm' as 'him'. 'miham' rendered 'mist' (also 'fog'). 'vṛtrāya pra vadham jabhāra' with the dative 'at Vṛtra'.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
